    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "So what did she tell you, Paprika?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "She said, war is war, and that's all there is to it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Indeed, that's all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "If she could just see the big picture, just how many things surrounding war would she see?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
