    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This intelligence must be delivered."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines has to admit that the Military Commission has drawn up a brilliant plan."
    },
    {
        "text": "She can foresee what will happen next."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Shard's Catastrophe will severely damage the dukes' forces, and furthermore, said damage will be credited to not just the Sarkaz, but also to their respective rivals."
    },
    {
        "text": "And once Victoria's storm-bringing prowess is drawn out into the open, any country across the lands will feel fear, and also fury."
    },
    {
        "text": "Every seat of power will want to destroy this one, or possess it for themselves."
    },
    {
        "text": "What if, at this time\u2014the dukes guarding the borders slack on their duties because of their infighting?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leithanien, Ursus, Kazimierz, and even the old Gaulish regions would never let this opportunity slip."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is only the first flame."
    },
    {
        "text": "Soon, an unstoppable blaze will sweep across the entire land."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines knows, there is still time, it's not too late."
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as she can get the information out\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "A shadow approaches at the end of the corridor. It is not her own shadow, but the owner of this vessel."
    },
    {
